[
  {
    "content_id": "10034001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是关于尼尼微的预言，是伊勒歌斯人那鸿的异象录。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和华是痛恨不贞、施行报应的上帝。 耶和华施行报应，充满烈怒。 耶和华报应祂的仇敌，向他们发烈怒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和华不轻易发怒，大有能力。 耶和华断不以有罪的为无罪。 祂行走在旋风和暴风中， 云彩是祂脚下的尘土。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂斥责大海，使大海干涸； 祂使一切河流枯竭。 巴珊和迦密的草木凋零， 黎巴嫩的鲜花衰残。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;在祂面前，群山震动，丘陵消融。 在祂面前，大地隆起， 世界和世上的一切都战栗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂发怒，谁能站立？ 祂发烈怒，谁能承受？ 祂的愤怒如火焰喷涌而出， 磐石在祂面前崩裂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和华是良善的， 是人患难时的避难所； 祂看顾那些信靠祂的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;祂必用滔滔洪水毁灭尼尼微， 把祂的敌人驱逐到黑暗中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微人啊， 你们为何图谋抵挡耶和华？ 祂要彻底毁灭你们， 无需击打两次。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们像纠结的荆棘， 又像酩酊大醉的人， 要如干秸被火烧尽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你们中间出来一人， 一个邪恶的阴谋者， 图谋抵挡耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “尽管尼尼微势力强大、人口众多， 但必被铲除，化为乌有。 我的子民啊，我使你们受了苦， 但必不再使你们受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;现在我要打碎他们套在你们颈上的轭， 松开你们身上的锁链。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微啊， 耶和华已发出有关你的命令： “你的名不会传于后世。 我要摧毁你神庙中雕刻和铸造的偶像。 我要为你掘好坟墓， 因为你毫无用处。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;看啊， 传喜讯、报平安的人穿山越岭而来。 犹大啊， 庆祝你的节期， 还你许的愿吧！ 邪恶之人将不再侵扰你， 他们都将被彻底毁灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微啊， 攻击者已经向你扑来。 你要进驻堡垒， 把守道路， 集中全力， 准备上阵！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;虽然掳掠者曾掳掠雅各， 掳掠以色列， 毁坏他们的葡萄树枝， 但耶和华必恢复雅各的荣耀， 恢复以色列的荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他的勇士手持红色盾牌， 他的士兵身穿朱红战衣。 他们整装待发之日， 战车铁光闪闪， 松木矛枪在空中挥舞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;战车在街道上狂奔， 在广场上横冲直撞， 亮如火炬，疾似闪电。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;亚述王召集将领， 他们一路跌跌撞撞， 奔上城墙，架起防御盾牌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;河闸大开，宫殿坍塌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;王后赤身被掳； 宫女捶胸悲泣， 像鸽子一样哀鸣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微城自古以来就像聚水的池子， 如今居民却像泄漏的池水四散奔逃。 虽有人喊：“站住！站住！” 却无人回头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;抢银子吧！抢金子吧！ 城里有无尽的财富和数不清的宝物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微被洗劫一空！ 沦为废墟！ 一片荒凉！ 人们胆战心惊，双膝哆嗦， 浑身发抖，面色苍白。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;如今那狮子的洞穴， 那喂养猛狮的地方在哪里呢？ 从前，雄狮、母狮和幼狮曾在那里出入， 无人惊扰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;雄狮为幼狮撕碎充足的食物， 为母狮绞杀猎物， 洞穴里堆满猎物， 堆满撕碎的肉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说： “我与你为敌， 我要烧毁你的战车， 使刀剑吞噬你的猛狮； 我要使你无法再掳掠他国， 你使者的声音将从此消逝。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;充满血腥的尼尼微有祸了！ 城中充满诡诈和掠夺， 害人的事从未止息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;鞭声啪啪，车轮隆隆， 战马奔腾，战车疾驰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;骑士冲锋，刀光闪闪，矛枪生辉； 被杀者众多，尸骨成堆， 人们被遍地的尸体绊倒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;这全是因为尼尼微像妖媚的妓女大肆淫乱， 惯行邪术， 以淫行诱惑列国， 靠邪术欺骗各族。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说： “我与你为敌。 我要把你的衣裙掀到你脸上， 使列国看见你的裸体， 使列邦看见你的羞耻。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我要把可憎之物抛在你身上， 羞辱你， 让众人观看。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;凡看见你的都要逃避，说， ‘尼尼微毁灭了！ 谁会为她悲伤呢？’ 我到哪里去寻找安慰你的人呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你能强过底比斯吗？ 底比斯位于尼罗河上， 四面环水， 水是她的屏障， 又是她的城墙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;古实和埃及是她无穷的力量， 弗人和利比亚人是她的帮手。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;可是，她却被掳去，流落他乡， 她的婴孩被摔死在各个街头。 她的官长被抽签瓜分， 她所有的首领都被锁链锁着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微啊， 你也必像醉汉一样， 你必寻找藏身之处躲避敌人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你所有的堡垒都像无花果树上的初熟果子， 一摇树，果子就掉进吃者口中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;看啊， 你的军队就像柔弱的女人， 你境内的关口向敌人敞开， 你的门闩被火烧毁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你要蓄水以防围困， 要加强防御！ 要走进土坑踩泥， 拿起砖模造砖！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;但在那里，火要吞噬你， 刀剑要杀戮你， 要像蝗虫吞没你。 你只管像蝗虫一样繁殖， 如蚱蜢一般增多吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你的商贾多过天上的繁星， 但他们像吃光田地后飞去的蝗虫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你的臣仆像蝗虫， 你的将领像成群的蚱蜢。 它们寒日聚集在墙上， 太阳一出来就飞走了， 无人知道它们的行踪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;亚述王啊！ 你的牧人沉睡，贵族酣眠， 你的百姓分散在群山上， 无人招聚他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10034003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "那鸿书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "34003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
